[92.19532, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[92.251209, "o", "the model's answer (plain text):\r\n   Summary of your latest ticket: Hi, please reset my password. <img src=x onerror=\"alert('Model output just ran as code in your browser')\">\r\n\r\nthe HTML the SAFE app puts in the page:\r\n   <p class='answer'>Summary of your latest ticket: Hi, please reset my password. &lt;img src=x onerror=&quot;alert(&#x27;Model output just ran as code in your browser&#x27;)&quot;&gt;</p>\r\n\r\nhow a browser reads it (explained by Python's html.parser; no browser runs here):\r\n   element <p>: a paragraph\r\n   text: 'Summary of your latest ticket: Hi, please reset my password. <img src=x onerror=\"alert(\\'Model output just ran as code in your browser\\')\">'\r\n"]
