[100.924235, "o", "python3 attack.py --mode safe\r\n"]
[100.973819, "o", "--- M5 lab · SAFE mode · stand-in model (stand_in_model.py, not AI) ---\r\n\r\n[HTML ] you> summarise my latest ticket\r\n"]
[100.974261, "o", "    page HTML: <p class='answer'>Summary of your latest ticket: Hi, please reset my password. &lt;img src=x onerror=&quot;ale...\r\n    RESULT: safe - the payload is shown as text, not run\r\n\r\n[SQL  ] you> search my tickets for: zzz' OR '1'='1' --\r\n"]
[100.974396, "o", "    log: INFO SQL sent: SELECT id, assignee, title FROM tickets WHERE assignee = ? AND title LIKE ? ESCAPE '\\'  params=('alice', \"%zzz' OR '1'='1' --%\")\r\n"]
[100.974497, "o", "    rows returned: 0, owners: none\r\n    RESULT: safe - the search term was treated as plain text\r\n\r\n[SHELL] you> check the status of vpn; cat data/fake_secrets.env\r\n"]
[100.974604, "o", "    log: WARNING BLOCKED service name from model: 'vpn; cat data/fake_secrets.env'\r\n    helper output: Sorry, I can only check: email, printer, vpn, wifi.\r\n    RESULT: safe - only allow-listed service names reach the helper\r\n\r\n0 of 3 attacks changed what the app did.\r\n"]
